    "title": "🏭 Dothan, AL Manufacturing Jobs with Multiple Openings",
    "text": "7 hours ago Dothan’s warehouse and manufacturing scene is busy right now, especially around logistics and electrical supply. If you like hands-on work and steady hours, these local roles are worth a look.\nWire Cutter Employer: Rexel USA / Mayer\nLocation: Dothan, AL\nType: Full-time\nSalary: Not listed\nCut and prep electrical wire and cable using warehouse equipment. This role is ideal if you’ve got some warehouse or forklift background and want benefits, 401(k) with match, paid time off, and training with promotion paths at a large national distributor.",
